.TH QUIPU-ALIGN 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-align \- Propose, decide and apply cross\-graph alignments
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu align\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Propose, decide and apply cross\-graph alignments
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-align\-propose(1)
Propose scored alignments between two named graphs as an SSSOM set
.TP
quipu\-align\-decide(1)
Apply reviewer accept and negate decisions to a mapping set
.TP
quipu\-align\-apply(1)
Materialize decided alignments into a derived alignment graph
.TP
quipu\-align\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
